00001: {"id":"CORE-C0001","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[3,3],"text":"分类：combat-requirements（创建输入、布局与参与资格）；性质：实现独立行为合同。","facts":[]}
00002: {"id":"CORE-C0002","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[5,5],"text":"本规格为净化正文：按统一交接将批准输入 WP39《战斗上下文与参与者》转写为独立行为文字，不含源文件路径、类名、行号与证据 URL（参考与已读集中登记于 `../../audit/source-traceability.md` 批次 10 条目）。文中保留的字段名、配置键与数据身份名均为数据标识，不构成未来实现的数据结构或接口模板。全部内容为静态证据；**无运行确认**（见 `../scope-statement.md`）。","facts":[]}
00003: {"id":"CORE-C0003","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[13,13],"text":"定义「一次战斗怎样被创建」——野生、训练家（含对视合并）与伙伴参与的入口接受什么输入、做什么校验、写哪些临时状态、以什么编组进入战斗；支持的单/双/三打与不对称布局、参与者（参战者）/所有者/队伍段/场上席位的对应关系；临时战斗规则与地图/地形/天气/时段的输入与默认值；创建期钩子的阶段与善后边界。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F003","CORE-F052","CORE-F053"]}
00004: {"id":"CORE-C0004","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[17,17],"text":"1. 战斗入口（野生/训练家包装与核心、输入解析与校验、跳过、返回值与写入）。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F003","CORE-F052","CORE-F053"]}
00005: {"id":"CORE-C0005","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[18,18],"text":"2. 战斗初始化与布局（侧尺寸、对决编组、参与者缩减规则、位置/邻近关系）。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F003","CORE-F052","CORE-F053"]}
00006: {"id":"CORE-C0006","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[19,19],"text":"3. 所有者、队伍段与席位（业主索引、队伍起止、伙伴参与与能力计数）。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F003","CORE-F052","CORE-F053"]}
00007: {"id":"CORE-C0007","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[20,20],"text":"4. 参战者初始化职责（字段复制、效果清零、离场/濒死/捕获的写入点；供 WP40/41/42 引用）。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F003","CORE-F052","CORE-F053"]}
00008: {"id":"CORE-C0008","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[21,21],"text":"5. 临时规则、环境输入与钩子时间线。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F003","CORE-F052","CORE-F053"]}
00009: {"id":"CORE-C0009","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[25,25],"text":"- 不定义招式结算、行动顺序与命令（WP40）、换人/位置/逃跑（WP41）、回合末与终局结算（WP42）、成长/学习（WP30/WP42）、捕获判定与接收（WP38）、完整战斗天气生命周期（WP45）、AI（WP51）、效果族（WP43–WP50）。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F003","CORE-F052","CORE-F053"]}
00010: {"id":"CORE-C0010","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[26,26],"text":"- 不定义界面演出与资源（WP16/WP67-A 前向）；不定义设施规则对象的完整语义（WP54–WP58 前向）；不设计未来实现的类/接口。","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F002","CORE-F003","CORE-F052","CORE-F053"]}
00011: {"id":"CORE-C0011","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[32,32],"text":"| 术语 | 定义 |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F003","CORE-F004"]}
00012: {"id":"CORE-C0012","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[34,34],"text":"| 战斗上下文 | 一次战斗的临时状态及呈现交接：包括双方参与个体与训练家身份、侧尺寸、场地/侧/位置效果、场上席位、回合计数、决定（decision）和临时规则。不规定容器、对象创建次序或类组织。 |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F003","CORE-F004"]}
00013: {"id":"CORE-C0013","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[35,35],"text":"| 入口包装 / 核心 | 野生/训练家包装（做对视合并、覆写钩子、事后钩子、返回值归一）与核心流程（做跳过、记录、创建、演出、善后、结果写入）。 |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F003","CORE-F004"]}
00014: {"id":"CORE-C0014","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[36,36],"text":"| 准入跳过（skip） | 在创建战斗前因「无任何可战斗成员」或「调试按住 Ctrl」而直接取消战斗的路径；不是失败也不是胜利。 |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F003","CORE-F004"]}
00015: {"id":"CORE-C0015","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[37,37],"text":"| 临时战斗规则字典 | 创建前由事件/脚本累积的规则字典与创建时复制/直写的战斗内规则字典；两者独立，键名与消费者不同。 |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F003","CORE-F004"]}
00016: {"id":"CORE-C0016","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[38,38],"text":"| 参与个体数组 | 交付战斗的有序成员集合，含玩家与实际参战伙伴各自的队伍段、对方训练家段或野生成员。成员身份及共享变更具有行为意义：伙伴参与时的合并集合可与后来玩家当前队伍的顺序分离，详 WP38/WP42；不要求使用数组实现。 |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F003","CORE-F004"]}
00017: {"id":"CORE-C0017","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[39,39],"text":"| 队伍段 | 某一位所有者（训练家）在参与数组中的连续区段，由队伍起始索引划分。 |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F003","CORE-F004"]}
00018: {"id":"CORE-C0018","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[40,40],"text":"| 参战者 | 一个场上席位（席位索引）。索引的奇偶决定所属侧（偶 = 玩家侧、奇 = 对方侧）；参战者持有对应个体引用与其队伍内索引。 |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F003","CORE-F004"]}
00019: {"id":"CORE-C0019","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[41,41],"text":"| 所有者（业主） | 控制某席位/某队伍段的训练家（玩家、伙伴或对方训练家）。「玩家拥有」仅指玩家本人（不是伙伴）。 |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F003","CORE-F004"]}
00020: {"id":"CORE-C0020","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[42,42],"text":"| 决定码 | 0 = 未决/中止、1 = 胜、2 = 负、3 = 逃/弃权、4 = 捕获、5 = 平局；结果写入基准游戏变量。 |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F003","CORE-F004"]}
00021: {"id":"CORE-C0021","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[43,43],"text":"| 伙伴 | 可临时参与玩家一侧的 AI 训练家；登记包含类型、名称、身份标识及队伍，身份标识的版本读取边界沿 WP24（由 WP24 领域写入与清除）。 |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F003","CORE-F004"]}
00022: {"id":"CORE-C0022","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[51,51],"text":"包装（输入：分隔式「物种+等级」、单参数 [物种， 等级] 数组、或已有个体对象；可覆盖标记缺省假）：","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00023: {"id":"CORE-C0023","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[53,53],"text":"1. 先生成对手个体数组（输入为分隔式或单参数数组时，唯一一次构造与生成修正钩子在此发生；已有个体对象参数直接复用，见 §3.3）。若恰 1 个对手且可覆盖：触发「呼唤野生战斗」覆写钩子——若钩子把截断标记设为非空值，立即返回该值（漫游个体/狩猎区/捕虫大会等改道入口；WP37/WP53 前向），不进入核心。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00024: {"id":"CORE-C0024","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[54,54],"text":"2. 否则进入核心执行（把生成好的个体对象逐一传入）；核心返回后，若恰 1 个对手且可覆盖：触发「野生战斗结束」钩子（物种， 等级， 结果）（雷达连锁消费，WP37 前向）。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00025: {"id":"CORE-C0025","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[55,55],"text":"3. 返回值归一：结果为 2（负）或 5（平）→ 假；其余结果（含 1 胜、3 逃/弃权、4 捕获）→ 真。返回值 ≠ 胜利判定，各模式分别归一。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00026: {"id":"CORE-C0026","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[57,57],"text":"核心步骤：","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00027: {"id":"CORE-C0027","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[59,59],"text":"1. 读取结果变量号（缺省 1）、可败标记（缺省假）。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00028: {"id":"CORE-C0028","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[60,60],"text":"2. 准入跳过：跳过条件为真 → 走跳过路径（§3.4）并返回其结果。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00029: {"id":"CORE-C0029","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[61,61],"text":"3. 触发「开始战斗」钩子（记录全队战前等级与计数清零，§3.5 钩子）。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00030: {"id":"CORE-C0030","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[62,62],"text":"4. 再次调用输入解析器，但复用对象身份：核心对每个参数重跑解析——参数已是个体对象时直接加入原引用（包装传入的正是这些对象），因此「物种+等级」的构造与生成修正钩子只发生一次，覆写钩子看到并修改的个体就是核心使用的个体；只有直接调用核心（无包装）并传入「物种+等级」时，才在此处首次构造。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00031: {"id":"CORE-C0031","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[63,63],"text":"5. 确定玩家侧参与集合（§3.5）及呈现交接，记录所有者队伍段与伙伴道具；若未显式设尺寸规则 → 默认 NvN（N = 对手个数）。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00032: {"id":"CORE-C0032","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[64,64],"text":"6. 创建期规则应用（§7.1）→ 清空创建期规则字典 → 开场动画包裹战斗开始 → 善后（§7.4）→ 输入刷新 → 结果写入基准变量（含统计增减）。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00033: {"id":"CORE-C0033","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[65,65],"text":"7. 返回原始结果码（包装再归一）。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00034: {"id":"CORE-C0034","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[67,67],"text":"时间线（按入口分列，不用混合箭头）：","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00035: {"id":"CORE-C0035","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[69,69],"text":"- 野生包装：生成对手（构造与生成修正一次）→ 覆写钩子（若可）→ 核心内 skip 检查（调试跳过时个体已生成）→「开始战斗」→ 以同一批个体对象开战。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00036: {"id":"CORE-C0036","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[70,70],"text":"- 直接核心（无包装）：skip 检查 →「开始战斗」→ 解析/生成（跳过时尚未生成）。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00037: {"id":"CORE-C0037","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[71,71],"text":"- 训练家包装·合并探测成立：满足 §3.2 探测条件时，数据参数先装载第一位训练家 A 并触发「训练家装载」钩子；保存的待战内容是已装载的 A 对象，本事件返回假。第二事件以另一训练家数据参数 B 正常进入核心时，先 skip 检查、再「开始战斗」，随后装载 B 并触发 B 的装载钩子，同时原样复用 A 对象；A 不再装载、不再触发装载钩子，第一次装载时对 A 的修改保留。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00038: {"id":"CORE-C0038","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[72,72],"text":"- 训练家包装·已探测装载但未存为待战：若装载后不满足「单一训练家且队伍不超上限」，包装以原输入进入自身核心；核心未 skip 时，原数据参数可再次装载并触发装载钩子。这与成功保存并复用待战对象的路径分开，不统一承诺所有包装的装载次数。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00039: {"id":"CORE-C0039","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[73,73],"text":"- 训练家核心（普通）：skip →「开始战斗」→ 解析训练家输入（数据参数装载并触发「训练家装载」；已有对象直接复用）→ 开战。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00040: {"id":"CORE-C0040","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[74,74],"text":"- 训练家对象输入：直接加入，不装载数据、不触发「训练家装载」（与数据装载路径分开）。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00041: {"id":"CORE-C0041","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[78,78],"text":"包装：","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00042: {"id":"CORE-C0042","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[80,80],"text":"1. 对视合并探测（仅当无待战训练家、地图解释器运行中、且可双打）：取当前事件的解释器自身；列出事件接触触发类型 2 的训练家事件（不是显示层或渲染优先级；还须满足训练家标记、距离／可达、非跳跃、非覆盖触发等候选门），排除自身与 A 开关已开的；恰有 1 个其它触发事件时，先按输入生成训练家——若为单一训练家且其队伍 ≤ 队伍上限，把它记入待战登记 = [训练家， 事件 id] 并立即返回假（本次事件不发起战斗；由第二个事件触发时合并）。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00043: {"id":"CORE-C0043","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[81,81],"text":"2. 若已有待战训练家：将已保存的训练家对象追加至本次输入，执行核心；本次数据参数按需装载，待战对象直接复用且不再次触发装载钩子。若结果为 1（胜）→ 把待战训练家事件的 A 开关置真；清空待战登记。否则直接执行核心。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00044: {"id":"CORE-C0044","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[82,82],"text":"3. 返回值为真仅当结果 = 1（胜），负/逃/平均为假。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00045: {"id":"CORE-C0045","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[84,84],"text":"核心：与野生同骨架；差异：对方为训练家数组（道具数组、队伍起始）；战斗对象携带对方训练家数组；默认尺寸 NvN（N = 训练家数）；开场动画类型 3（非单打）或 1（单打）；结果写入带训练家战斗标记的统计分支。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00046: {"id":"CORE-C0046","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[88,88],"text":"野生输入逐项扫描：","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00047: {"id":"CORE-C0047","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[90,90],"text":"- 个体对象 → 直接加入原引用；若遇到该参数时前面仍有物种在等待配对等级，则报错「物种 {species} 已给出但未给等级」。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00048: {"id":"CORE-C0048","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[91,91],"text":"- [物种， 等级] 数组 → 以物种校验后经野生生成入口生成（WP36 生成修正钩子链）。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00049: {"id":"CORE-C0049","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[92,92],"text":"- 物种 id → 暂存，等待下一个「等级」整数（1..最大等级，含两端校验）；非整数或越界 → 报错「期望等级 (1..N) 但 X 不是数字或不是有效等级」。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00050: {"id":"CORE-C0050","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[93,93],"text":"- 未知物种 id → 报错「物种 {X} 不存在」。","facts":["CORE-F052","CORE-F053","CORE-F054","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
